# carbonio-core < 4.10.0 shipped these scheduled-job units. Replaces lets dpkg
# take the files over when carbonio-mta is unpacked before core is upgraded.
# Noble only: it is the only Debian package that ships the units, and on RPM yap
# would turn replaces into Obsoletes.
